39	 * side, so it gets the same answer — and it is said out loud, because "ignored a
40	 * flag" and "there was no flag" must not look alike afterwards.
41	 *
42	 * Every flag these scripts take is a string, so that is all this reads. Absent is
43	 * "", which is what each of them already treats as absent.
